          "new_start": 163,
          "new_end": 164,
          "old": "First subtract a constant from $u$ so that $u\\leq0$; this does not change any of the envelope claims. The regularization can be chosen for this normalized function. Then $b_j\\geq c_ju\\geq u$. Put $r_j=P_\\omega[b_j]=Q_\\omega[b_j]$. The same competitor argument gives\n",
