          "new_start": 171,
          "new_end": 172,
          "old": "The squeeze and ideal argument in the theorem proves $r_j\\downarrow Q_\\omega[u]$ pointwise and in $L^1$. For an originally unnormalized $u$, add the subtracted constant back to $b_j$; this restores convergence to $u$ and changes none of the singularity types or envelopes.\n",
